---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Checkout & Order Details
description: Complete your details to reserve your handcrafted Biltong Bites order.
---

<article class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
  <header class="mb-8">
    <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-olive mb-1">Order Reservation</div>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-dark">Complete Your Order</h1>
    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-dark/70 mt-1">Enter your details below to reserve your handcrafted biltong packs.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
    
    <!-- Form Side -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-micro border border-brand-border shadow-card">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-slate-dark mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-brand-border">
        1. Contact &amp; Pickup Details
      </h2>

      <form id="checkout-form" class="space-y-4">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div>
            <label for="name" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-dark mb-1">First and Last Name</label>
            <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required placeholder="e.g. John Doe" autocomplete="name" class="w-full bg-parchment/60 border border-brand-border px-3.5 py-2.5 text-xs rounded-micro focus:outline-none focus:border-paprika" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="phone" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-dark mb-1">Mobile Phone Number</label>
            <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" required placeholder="e.g. 021 000 0000" autocomplete="tel" class="w-full bg-parchment/60 border border-brand-border px-3.5 py-2.5 text-xs rounded-micro focus:outline-none focus:border-paprika" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="email" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-dark mb-1">Email Address</label>
          <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required placeholder="e.g. john@example.com" autocomplete="email" class="w-full bg-parchment/60 border border-brand-border px-3.5 py-2.5 text-xs rounded-micro focus:outline-none focus:border-paprika" />
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 bg-parchment rounded-micro border border-brand-border text-xs space-y-1 text-slate-dark/80">
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-dark flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-olive" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
            Pickup Location: Long Bay College, Auckland
          </div>
          <p>Orders are fulfilled directly by our student team. You will receive an email confirmation with bank details to complete payment.</p>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="w-full py-4 bg-paprika hover:bg-paprika-hover text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-micro shadow-card transition" id="place-order-btn">
          Place Order &amp; Receive Payment Details
        </button>
      </form>
      <div id="email-preview" class="email-preview mt-4"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Summary Side -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-micro border border-brand-border shadow-card">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-slate-dark mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-brand-border">
        2. Order Summary
      </h2>

      <div id="checkout-order-items" class="divide-y divide-brand-border/60 text-xs mb-4">
        <!-- Dynamically rendered by main.js -->
      </div>

      <div class="pt-3 border-t border-brand-border space-y-2 text-xs">
        <div class="flex justify-between">
          <span class="text-slate-dark/70">Subtotal:</span>
          <span id="checkout-subtotal-amount" class="font-bold text-slate-dark">$0.00</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between text-emerald-800">
          <span>School Pickup:</span>
          <span class="font-semibold">Free</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between text-base font-bold text-slate-dark pt-2 border-t border-brand-border">
          <span>Total Due:</span>
          <span id="checkout-total-amount" class="text-paprika">$0.00</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a href="/cart/" class="block text-center mt-6 text-xs font-bold text-slate-dark/60 hover:text-paprika underline">
        Modify Cart Items
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</article>
